cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use TAi or refer to it, please cite the thesis that describes it."
title: "TAi: an agentic AI teaching assistant for a graduate distributed systems course"
abstract: >-
  TAi is the AI teaching assistant of CS6650 Building Scalable Distributed Systems at
  Northeastern University's Vancouver campus. It offers practice interviews by voice;
  a weekly brief built from the student's own code, submissions and posts; a Go sandbox;
  a student record written by host code; a weekday patrol; course-system tools bound to
  each student; and a teaching-team page. It is a fork of NanoClaw. The tag
  thesis-2026-12 is the version the thesis describes.
type: software
